      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "sourceEntry": 1295,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Well, I wish you could!",
      "src": "audio/pages/80/lines/004_monica_71a244e0a63_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.3,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "sourceEntry": 1296,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Oh, I think it’s very funny. The two worst tempered people I know, together. I hope you had a wonderful time.",
      "src": "audio/pages/80/lines/005_penny_ecc7e166e77_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 7.849,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "sourceEntry": 1297,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "We did.",
      "src": "audio/pages/80/lines/006_monica_16860046559_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.789,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "sourceEntry": 1298,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I don’t want to know.",
      "src": "audio/pages/80/lines/007_penny_26c0cc40adf_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.44,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "sourceEntry": 1299,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "No, you never want to know. You’ve never had an honest moment in your entire life. My God, we don’t even know how old you are.",
      "src": "audio/pages/80/lines/008_monica_dc6bfde0951_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 5.248,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "sourceEntry": 1300,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I’d never tell you. You’d use it against me. You’ve always had a very low moral code, Monica.",
      "src": "audio/pages/80/lines/009_penny_7bd5a677c27_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 6.502,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "sourceEntry": 1301,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "At least I’ve had a great deal of fun. Which is more than I can say for you.",
      "src": "audio/pages/80/lines/010_monica_626eaf6c47a_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 4.087,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "sourceEntry": 1302,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Well you’ve had so much more practice. At school you went through a whole football team.",
      "src": "audio/pages/80/lines/011_penny_6fdc645d560_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 5.248,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "sourceEntry": 1303,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Now you’re being really vulgar!",
      "src": "audio/pages/80/lines/012_monica_78181f48ccb_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.533,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
